<h1>Thaddeus Jones</h1>
<p>Illinois House, 29th District, on the Chicago ballot November 3, 2026. Party: Democratic. Incumbent.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.repthaddeusjones.com/" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (repthaddeusjones.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>His site highlights auto and property insurance affordability and consumer protections in insurance claims; he chairs the House Insurance Committee. His ilga.gov record also covers property taxes, health care access and economic development in Calumet City.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>Serves as mayor of Calumet City, was the city&#39;s first Black alderman for its Third Ward, founded the Jones Foundation, and holds a criminal justice degree from Loyola University.</p>
